          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold">Marie T.</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Lyon</span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 10%, transparent); padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 9999px;">
                <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                Achat v&eacute;rifi&eacute;
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="star-rating text-xs" aria-label="5 sur 5">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">&laquo;&nbsp;Incroyable, je l'ai viss&eacute; en 10 secondes et &ccedil;a change la vie en &eacute;t&eacute;&nbsp;! La lumi&egrave;re est douce et le ventilo super silencieux.&nbsp;&raquo;</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground" style="opacity: 0.6;">il y a 2 jours</p>
      </div>

